OL,3,GNEWSAScottish DJ, 32, confirmed as
OL,4,Avictim of Krakow shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 32-year-old Scottish man has been
OL,7,Fconfirmed as one of the victims of a
OL,8,Fmass shooting in Poland that left six
OL,9,Fpeople dead.
OL,11,FThe man, who is understood to be James
OL,12,FThomas Campbell from Prestwick in South
OL,13,FAyrshire, died when a lone gunman
OL,14,Fopened fire in central Krakow on
OL,15,FSaturday.
OL,17,FCampbell worked as a DJ in Ayrshire.
OL,18,FPolice Scotland confirmed it was
OL,19,Fproviding specialist support to the
OL,20,Fvictim's family, but formal
OL,21,Fidentification is yet to be carried
OL,22,Fout.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
